<\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"496\">Pro\u010d <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/ira-scope\/\">IRa-SCOPE<\/a>?<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"645\"><strong data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"523\">T\u0159i metody v jednom:<\/strong> mikro-IR (LDIR), nano-IR (nano-FTIR, AFM-IR) a Ramanova spektroskopie dopln\u011bn\u00e9 o mechanickou charakterizaci pomoc\u00ed AFM.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"757\"><strong data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"671\">Korelativn\u00ed m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed:<\/strong> snadn\u00e9 kombinov\u00e1n\u00ed r\u016fzn\u00fdch re\u017eim\u016f bez slo\u017eit\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edpravy \u2013 v\u00edce dat z jednoho vzorku.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"867\"><strong data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"791\">Prakti\u010dnost a spolehlivost:<\/strong> automatizovan\u00e9 p\u0159ep\u00edn\u00e1n\u00ed re\u017eim\u016f, rozpozn\u00e1n\u00ed vzork\u016f i nastaven\u00ed p\u0159\u00edstroje.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12750\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12750\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12750 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/09\/ebf48527-1024x204.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"159\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/09\/ebf48527-1024x204.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/09\/ebf48527-300x60.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/09\/ebf48527-768x153.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/09\/ebf48527.png 1428w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12750\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">IRa-SCOPE: nov\u00e1 dimenze va\u0161eho v\u00fdzkumu<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"896\">\u0160irok\u00e9 mo\u017enosti vyu\u017eit\u00ed<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"1157\">IRa-SCOPE posouv\u00e1 hranic